[Trigger]
Name	landfall
Mode	once
Cond	time	3
Action	message	1	The storm is breaking on Stormhaven, master. Captain Ivo Strand lets four keepers share his coast, and each thinks the harbour is his alone.
Action	objective	1	Destroy the heart of every rival keeper.
Action	objective	1	Cross the inlet by the stone spans.
Action	objective	1	Do not let the keepers join their strength against you.
Action	portal	2	off
Action	portal	3	off
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	coveHeld
Mode	once
Cond	claimed	1	Cove	30
Action	message	1	Your cove is secure. The road north runs up the east quay, and another leads west along the shore.
Action	reveal	1	EastQuay
Action	reveal	1	WestCove
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	quayEntered
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	EastQuay
Action	message	1	The east quay. Its keeper has called on the north-east cliff for help, and a squad is already on the road.
Action	alliance	3	5	make
Action	portal	3	on
Action	reveal	1	Basin
Action	spawn	3	51	39	1	Orc:3	Troll:3	Spider:3	Goblin:3
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	dockEntered
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	WestDock
Action	message	1	The west dock. The keeper here has sent a runner across the south span to the quay.
Action	alliance	2	4	make
Action	portal	2	on
Action	reveal	1	SouthSpan
Action	spawn	5	37	71	1	Orc:3	Troll:3	Goblin:3
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	spanSeen
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	SouthSpan
Action	message	1	A stone span crosses the black water here. Everything that crosses will cross under your eyes.
Action	reveal	1	NorthSpan
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	basinSeen
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Basin
Action	message	1	The harbour basin. Sea stacks stand in the water like teeth, and the keepers are watching from the banks.
Action	spawn	1	50	79	1	Orc:3	Troll:3	Spider:3
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	northSpan
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	NorthSpan
Action	message	1	The north span. The two northern keepers are now at your back door and at each other.
Action	reveal	1	NorthEast
Action	reveal	1	NorthWest
Action	reveal	1	Lighthouse
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	lightSeen
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Lighthouse
Action	message	1	Below the old lighthouse the earth is soft. Something is walled up in the north.
Action	reveal	1	GaleCave
Action	gold	1	600
Action	terrain	30	15	30	15	manawell
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	gale
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	GaleCave
Action	message	1	A gale cave of heaped coin. The harbourmaster hid his tithe here.
Action	gold	1	1500
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	mined1
Mode	once
Cond	mined	1	>=	3000
Action	message	1	The coast seams are paying. Hold the gold and the keepers will fall one at a time.
[/Trigger]
